<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκατα-χράομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>use up beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἐφοδίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Comp.Dion.Brut.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				10.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				36
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				48
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				103
			</span></i>: pf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὸ
				προκατακεχρῆσθαι</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς
				ἐκκλησίας</span>), in pass. sense, or (if <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ἐκκλησίαις</span> be supplied) in act.
			sense, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.154
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply,
				<i>employ first,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Καίσαρι ἔς τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					3.51
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>kill before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					53.23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
